<div id="S4.SS5.p4" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="S4.SS5.p4.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S4.SS5.p4.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Static Penalty Analysis:</span> The temporal variation penalty achieves superior motion dynamics (dynamic degree 0.710 vs 0.627) while maintaining comparable geometric consistency and motion quality. This component effectively prevents degenerate static solutions while preserving the geometric alignment.</p>
</div>
<figure id="S4.T6" class="ltx_table">
